@startuml
title Figure Y: Maintenance Task Completion Participant Diagram

' Professional Styling
skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam handwritten false
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 10

skinparam boundary {
    BackgroundColor #f0f7ff
    BorderColor #0078d4
}

skinparam control {
    BackgroundColor #fff9e6
    BorderColor #d4a017
}

skinparam entity {
    BackgroundColor #f6fff6
    BorderColor #228b22
}

skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #fff9e6
    BorderColor #d4a017
    FontSize 11
}

actor "Maintenance Staff" as User
boundary "Maintenance Page" as UI <<Boundary>>
control "SupabaseMaintenanceService" as Service <<Control>>
entity "Maintenance Tasks" as Tasks <<Entity>>
entity "Maintenance History" as History <<Entity>>
entity "Maintenance Stats" as Stats <<Entity>>

User - UI : 1: Mark Task as Completed
UI - Service : 2: completeTask(id, data)
Service - Tasks : 3: Update Status & Next Due Date
Service - History : 4: Insert Completion Record
Service - Stats : 5: Update/Insert Performance Stats
Service - UI : 6: Success Response
UI - User : 7: Refresh Task List & Stats

note right of UI
  **Alternative Flow:**
  If DB update fails,
  UI displays error
  and maintains state.
end note

@enduml
